{"page_num":1,"image_width":2481,"image_height":3508,"created_at":"2026-10-02T06:29:55.631903Z","blocks":[{"block_id":"p1-b1","coordinates":{"x1":259,"y1":253,"x2":860,"y2":357},"bbox_norm":[0.10439338976219266,0.07212086659064994,0.34663442160419183,0.10176738882554162],"layout_tag":"section-title","confidence":0.6909,"reading_order":1,"text":"DocuSaathi"},{"block_id":"p1-b2","coordinates":{"x1":252,"y1":382,"x2":1630,"y2":443},"bbox_norm":[0.10157194679564692,0.1088939566704675,0.6569931479242241,0.12628278221208666],"layout_tag":"paragraph","confidence":0.7075,"reading_order":2,"text":"Government document-to-action assistant, built on Sarvam AI"},{"block_id":"p1-b3","coordinates":{"x1":236,"y1":488,"x2":2242,"y2":911},"bbox_norm":[0.0951229343006852,0.13911060433295325,0.9036678758565094,0.2596921322690992],"layout_tag":"table","confidence":0.9604,"reading_order":3,"text":"\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eHackathon track\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eApplied AI\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eProblem statement\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003ePS 41: use at least one Sarvam API to solve a problem that matters\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eDuration\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e24 hours\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eOne-line pitch\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003ePhotograph any confusing official document and get, in your own language and by voice, what it is, what you must do, and by when.\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e"},{"block_id":"p1-b4","coordinates":{"x1":254,"y1":978,"x2":711,"y2":1050},"bbox_norm":[0.10237807335751713,0.27879133409350054,0.28657799274486095,0.2993158494868871],"layout_tag":"section-title","confidence":0.8779,"reading_order":4,"text":"1. The problem"},{"block_id":"p1-b5","coordinates":{"x1":250,"y1":1080,"x2":2120,"y2":1318},"bbox_norm":[0.1007658202337767,0.30786773090079816,0.8544941555824265,0.3757126567844926],"layout_tag":"paragraph","confidence":0.9453,"reading_order":5,"text":"Official notices, bank letters, scheme forms and land records are dense and usually written in formal English or bureaucratic language. Millions of people in India cannot easily read them, so they miss deadlines, skip benefits or depend on middlemen. Most AI tools are built for English speakers, which leaves exactly these users behind."},{"block_id":"p1-b6","coordinates":{"x1":252,"y1":1383,"x2":708,"y2":1452},"bbox_norm":[0.10157194679564692,0.3942417331812999,0.28536880290205563,0.41391106043329534],"layout_tag":"section-title","confidence":0.876,"reading_order":6,"text":"2. The solution"},{"block_id":"p1-b7","coordinates":{"x1":250,"y1":1482,"x2":2230,"y2":1596},"bbox_norm":[0.1007658202337767,0.4224629418472064,0.8988311164852882,0.4549600912200684],"layout_tag":"paragraph","confidence":0.9067,"reading_order":7,"text":"DocuSaathi converts a photo or PDF of an official document into an action plan. It does not just translate. It answers three questions:"},{"block_id":"p1-b8","coordinates":{"x1":263,"y1":1619,"x2":1258,"y2":1675},"bbox_norm":[0.10600564288593309,0.46151653363740025,0.5070536074163644,0.4774800456100342],"layout_tag":"paragraph","confidence":0.8193,"reading_order":8,"text":"• What is this? The document type and who sent it."},{"block_id":"p1-b9","coordinates":{"x1":265,"y1":1686,"x2":1362,"y2":1739},"bbox_norm":[0.10681176944780331,0.4806157354618016,0.5489721886336155,0.4957240592930445],"layout_tag":"paragraph","confidence":0.8335,"reading_order":9,"text":"• What do I have to do? A prioritized checklist of actions."},{"block_id":"p1-b10","coordinates":{"x1":260,"y1":1759,"x2":1832,"y2":1811},"bbox_norm":[0.10479645304312778,0.5014253135689852,0.7384119306731157,0.516248574686431],"layout_tag":"paragraph","confidence":0.8394,"reading_order":10,"text":"• By when, and what happens if I don't? Deadlines, amounts and consequences."},{"block_id":"p1-b11","coordinates":{"x1":249,"y1":1826,"x2":2212,"y2":1942},"bbox_norm":[0.1003627569528416,0.5205245153933865,0.8915759774284563,0.5535917901938426],"layout_tag":"paragraph","confidence":0.8906,"reading_order":11,"text":"The answer is given in the user's language as text and as voice, and the user can ask follow-up questions by speaking."},{"block_id":"p1-b12","coordinates":{"x1":252,"y1":2014,"x2":711,"y2":2080},"bbox_norm":[0.10157194679564692,0.5741163055872291,0.28657799274486095,0.5929304446978335],"layout_tag":"section-title","confidence":0.877,"reading_order":12,"text":"3. Target users"},{"block_id":"p1-b13","coordinates":{"x1":263,"y1":2106,"x2":1843,"y2":2166},"bbox_norm":[0.10600564288593309,0.6003420752565565,0.7428456267634018,0.6174458380843786],"layout_tag":"paragraph","confidence":0.8657,"reading_order":13,"text":"• Elderly citizens and first-generation literate users who struggle with formal English."},{"block_id":"p1-b14","coordinates":{"x1":263,"y1":2178,"x2":1387,"y2":2234},"bbox_norm":[0.10600564288593309,0.620866590649943,0.5590487706569931,0.636830102622577],"layout_tag":"paragraph","confidence":0.8716,"reading_order":14,"text":"• Rural and semi-urban users who prefer voice over typing."},{"block_id":"p1-b15","coordinates":{"x1":265,"y1":2246,"x2":1435,"y2":2300},"bbox_norm":[0.10681176944780331,0.6402508551881414,0.5783958081418783,0.6556442417331813],"layout_tag":"paragraph","confidence":0.8667,"reading_order":15,"text":"• Small business owners handling tax, GST and bank notices."},{"block_id":"p1-b16","coordinates":{"x1":266,"y1":2316,"x2":1658,"y2":2370},"bbox_norm":[0.10721483272873841,0.6602052451539339,0.6682789197904071,0.6755986316989738],"layout_tag":"paragraph","confidence":0.8374,"reading_order":16,"text":"• Family members and community workers helping others with paperwork."},{"block_id":"p1-b17","coordinates":{"x1":228,"y1":3354,"x2":919,"y2":3402},"bbox_norm":[0.09189842805320435,0.9561003420752565,0.3704151551793632,0.9697833523375142],"layout_tag":"footer","confidence":0.8628,"reading_order":17,"text":"DocuSaathi | Applied AI | PS 41 (Sarvam API)"},{"block_id":"p1-b18","coordinates":{"x1":2132,"y1":3356,"x2":2246,"y2":3400},"bbox_norm":[0.8593309149536478,0.9566704675028507,0.9052801289802499,0.9692132269099202],"layout_tag":"page-number","confidence":0.7969,"reading_order":18,"text":"Page 1"}]}